# Copy to .env (git-ignored) and fill in. Never commit .env.
# Free key: https://fred.stlouisfed.org/docs/api/api_key.html
# Needed by `wsl data fetch` (the research cache is built from the FRED API). Optional for
# `wsl live run`: without a key it reads the same series from FRED's public CSV download.
FRED_API_KEY=
